  <NAME>Valine tRNA biogenesis and bioavailability regulates mitochondrial complex I levels in acute leukemia [CRISPR screen]</NAME>
  <TITLE>Valine tRNA biogenesis and bioavailability regulates mitochondrial complex I levels in acute leukemia [CRISPR screen]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We report the effects of gene knockout via CRISPR/Cas9 system targeting either the whole genome or specifically genes involved in tRNA biogenesis in T cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia cell lines under normal versus valine limited media. Overall design: Examination of CRISPR/Cas9 sgRNA "brunello" library (targeting the whole genome) or a tRNA-gene specific library in T-ALL cell lines in normal or differential valine conditions.</DESCRIPTION>
